{"id":"anhui-gaokao-2013-cloze-language-learning","familyId":"anhui-2013-cloze-language-learning","skillIds":["cloze.logic","vocab.collocation","grammar.tense"],"level":"G1","section":"cloze","reviewMode":"transfer","promptZh":"阅读下面短文，从每题所给的 A、B、C、D 四个选项中选出最佳选项（2013 年安徽卷第 36-55 题）。","resourceId":"anhui-gaokao-2013-cloze-language-learning","estimatedSeconds":420,"sourceIds":["anhui-gaokao-2013-official"],"explanation":{"summaryZh":"文章讨论学习新语言的动机、方法、时间投入和保持信心的重要性。","ruleZh":"完形填空需要结合上下文逻辑、固定搭配、词义辨析和语法结构判断。","evidence":[{"resourceId":"anhui-gaokao-2013-cloze-language-learning","paragraphId":"p1","quote":"Most people learn best"}],"distractors":[]},"kind":"gaps","inputMode":"options","sharedOptions":[],"uniqueOptions":true,"segments":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to learn a new language, the very first thing to think about is why. Do you need it for a"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g36"},{"type":"text","text":" reason, such as your job or your studies?"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g37"},{"type":"text","text":" perhaps you're interested in the"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g38"},{"type":"text","text":", films or music of a different country and you know how much it will help to have a"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g39"},{"type":"text","text":" of the language.\n\nMost people learn best using a variety of"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g40"},{"type":"text","text":", but traditional classes are an ideal start for many people. They"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g41"},{"type":"text","text":" an environment where you can practise under the"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g42"},{"type":"text","text":" of someone who's good at the language. We all lead"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g43"},{"type":"text","text":" lives and learning a language takes"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g44"},{"type":"text","text":". You will have more success if you study regularly, so try to develop a"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g45"},{"type":"text","text":". It doesn't matter if you haven't got long. Becoming fluent in a language will take years, but learning to get by takes"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g46"},{"type":"text","text":".\n\nMany people start learning a language and soon give up. \"I'm too"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g47"},{"type":"text","text":",\" they say. Yes, children do learn languages more"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g48"},{"type":"text","text":" than adults, but research has shown that you can learn a language at any"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g49"},{"type":"text","text":". And learning is good for the health of your brain, too. I've also heard people"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g50"},{"type":"text","text":" about the mistakes they make when"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g51"},{"type":"text","text":". Well, relax and laugh about your mistakes"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g52"},{"type":"text","text":" you're much less likely to make them again.\n\nLearning a new language is never"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g53"},{"type":"text","text":". But with some work and devotion, you'll make progress. And you'll be"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g54"},{"type":"text","text":" by the positive reaction of some people when you say just a few words in"},{"type":"gap","gapId":"g55"},{"type":"text","text":" own language. Good luck!"}],"gaps":[{"id":"g36","label":"36","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g36a","text":"technical"},{"id":"g36b","text":"political"},{"id":"g36c","text":"practical"},{"id":"g36d","text":"physical"}],"accepted":["g36c"],"explanationZh":"工作或学习需要属于实际用途，practical reason 搭配合理。"},{"id":"g37","label":"37","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g37a","text":"After"},{"id":"g37b","text":"So"},{"id":"g37c","text":"Though"},{"id":"g37d","text":"Or"}],"accepted":["g37d"],"explanationZh":"前后是学习语言的两种可能动机，Or 表示选择另一种情况。"},{"id":"g38","label":"38","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g38a","text":"literature"},{"id":"g38b","text":"transport"},{"id":"g38c","text":"agriculture"},{"id":"g38d","text":"medicine"}],"accepted":["g38a"],"explanationZh":"与 films or music 并列的是 literature。"},{"id":"g39","label":"39","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g39a","text":"view"},{"id":"g39b","text":"knowledge"},{"id":"g39c","text":"form"},{"id":"g39d","text":"database"}],"accepted":["g39b"],"explanationZh":"have a knowledge of 是表示了解某语言的固定搭配。"},{"id":"g40","label":"40","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g40a","text":"paintings"},{"id":"g40b","text":"regulations"},{"id":"g40c","text":"methods"},{"id":"g40d","text":"computers"}],"accepted":["g40c"],"explanationZh":"a variety of methods 表示多种学习方法。"},{"id":"g41","label":"41","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g41a","text":"protect"},{"id":"g41b","text":"change"},{"id":"g41c","text":"respect"},{"id":"g41d","text":"provide"}],"accepted":["g41d"],"explanationZh":"provide an environment 表示提供环境。"},{"id":"g42","label":"42","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g42a","text":"control"},{"id":"g42b","text":"command"},{"id":"g42c","text":"guidance"},{"id":"g42d","text":"pressure"}],"accepted":["g42c"],"explanationZh":"under the guidance of 表示在某人的指导下。"},{"id":"g43","label":"43","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g43a","text":"busy"},{"id":"g43b","text":"happy"},{"id":"g43c","text":"simple"},{"id":"g43d","text":"normal"}],"accepted":["g43a"],"explanationZh":"busy lives 与后文学习需要时间形成语义联系。"},{"id":"g44","label":"44","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g44a","text":"courage"},{"id":"g44b","text":"time"},{"id":"g44c","text":"energy"},{"id":"g44d","text":"place"}],"accepted":["g44b"],"explanationZh":"learning a language takes time 是常见表达。"},{"id":"g45","label":"45","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g45a","text":"theory"},{"id":"g45b","text":"business"},{"id":"g45c","text":"routine"},{"id":"g45d","text":"project"}],"accepted":["g45c"],"explanationZh":"定期学习需要形成 routine。"},{"id":"g46","label":"46","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g46a","text":"some risks"},{"id":"g46b","text":"a lot less"},{"id":"g46c","text":"some notes"},{"id":"g46d","text":"a lot more"}],"accepted":["g46b"],"explanationZh":"达到基本交流水平比达到流利程度需要少得多的时间。"},{"id":"g47","label":"47","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g47a","text":"old"},{"id":"g47b","text":"nervous"},{"id":"g47c","text":"weak"},{"id":"g47d","text":"tired"}],"accepted":["g47a"],"explanationZh":"后文把儿童和成年人比较，放弃者说自己太老。"},{"id":"g48","label":"48","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g48a","text":"closely"},{"id":"g48b","text":"quickly"},{"id":"g48c","text":"privately"},{"id":"g48d","text":"quietly"}],"accepted":["g48b"],"explanationZh":"learn more quickly 表示学习得更快。"},{"id":"g49","label":"49","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g49a","text":"age"},{"id":"g49b","text":"speed"},{"id":"g49c","text":"distance"},{"id":"g49d","text":"school"}],"accepted":["g49a"],"explanationZh":"at any age 表示在任何年龄。"},{"id":"g50","label":"50","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g50a","text":"worry"},{"id":"g50b","text":"hesitate"},{"id":"g50c","text":"think"},{"id":"g50d","text":"quarrel"}],"accepted":["g50a"],"explanationZh":"worry about mistakes 表示为错误担心。"},{"id":"g51","label":"51","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g51a","text":"singing"},{"id":"g51b","text":"working"},{"id":"g51c","text":"bargaining"},{"id":"g51d","text":"learning"}],"accepted":["g51d"],"explanationZh":"make mistakes when learning 表示学习时犯错。"},{"id":"g52","label":"52","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g52a","text":"if"},{"id":"g52b","text":"and"},{"id":"g52c","text":"but"},{"id":"g52d","text":"before"}],"accepted":["g52b"],"explanationZh":"放松并笑对错误，就不太可能再次犯错，and 连接结果。"},{"id":"g53","label":"53","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g53a","text":"tiresome"},{"id":"g53b","text":"hard"},{"id":"g53c","text":"interesting"},{"id":"g53d","text":"easy"}],"accepted":["g53d"],"explanationZh":"Learning a new language is never easy 表示学习新语言并不容易，后文说明坚持努力仍会取得进步。"},{"id":"g54","label":"54","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g54a","text":"blamed"},{"id":"g54b","text":"amazed"},{"id":"g54c","text":"interrupted"},{"id":"g54d","text":"informed"}],"accepted":["g54b"],"explanationZh":"别人对学习者说出的语言作出积极反应，会使其感到惊喜。"},{"id":"g55","label":"55","clue":null,"options":[{"id":"g55a","text":"their"},{"id":"g55b","text":"his"},{"id":"g55c","text":"our"},{"id":"g55d","text":"your"}],"accepted":["g55a"],"explanationZh":"some people 的物主代词是 their。"}],"policy":{"caseSensitive":false,"allowTerminalPunctuation":true}}
